  "instructions": [
    "Combine water chestnuts, carrots, and celery in a bowl.",
    "Mince the garlic and ginger and add to the bowl.",
    "Mix in Korean chili flakes.",
    "In a small saucepan, combine fish sauce, rice vinegar, sugar, and sesame oil.",
    "Bring the sauce to a boil over medium heat.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning with salt and black pepper.",
    "Pour the sauce over the water chestnut mixture and toss to combine.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a slate-tile bowl or plate.",
    "Garnish with chopped green onions and serve.",
    "Refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "Serve chilled or at room temperature.",
    "Adjust the amount of Korean chili flakes to taste for desired level of spiciness."
